r &amp;amp;= 1 + (T_{6n} \bmod 399)
\end{align}

&lt;p&gt;where $T_1,\dots,T_{300000}$ come from the &#34;Lagged Fibonacci Generator&#34;:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul style=&#34;list-style-type:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;li&gt;For $1 \le k \le 55$, $T_k = [100003 - 200003k + 300007k^3] \pmod{1000000}$.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;For $56 \le k$, $T_k = [T_{k -24} + T_{k - 55}] \pmod{1000000}$.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;

